  "details": "I was unable to resolve this issue using the AI assistant at \n\nhttps://help.vrchat.com/hc/en-us/requests\n\n, which is why I’m posting this.\n\nI believe there are other users experiencing the same problem.\n\n・As shown in the attached screenshot, I can no longer write notes. I understand that I’ve reached the limit.\n\nHowever, this is extremely inconvenient for future gameplay. Therefore, please let me know the following:\n\n① Is there a way to expand or increase this limit?\n\n② If that’s not possible, is there a way to delete notes I wrote in the past or notes from specific people in bulk? (For example, deleting all notes from people who haven’t logged in for over six months.)\n\n③ Please tell me how to view the notes I’ve written so far or the players I’ve written notes to.\n\n④ If there are any other ways to resolve this issue, please let me know.\n\nI want to use notes to make lots of friends.\n\nThank you for your help.",
